ed by the Income Tax Department, and a GSTIN is the 15-character Goods and Services Tax Identification Number issued to registered businesses. This tool validates the format of a PAN or GSTIN and decodes what is inside it: the entity type, the state code and the checksum. It is a quick way to catch typing mistakes in invoices and forms. It does not confirm that a number is active with the government."}]]}],["$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29"]]}],"$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e"]}],"$L2f"]}],"$L30"]}]
